Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: A Cicada Splices the Step-Up Transformer
- Story & Context: When sixteen-year-old wire-head Ren broke the rusted fire door of the flooded Carousel Galleria, the scent of stagnant rainwater and scorched phenolic resin clung to the carcass of an upright cabinet whose fried audio board was humming in perfect D-minor. He jammed a raw dynamic microphone into the monitor’s high-voltage circuit with alligator clips, startling a dormant swarm of periodical cicadas that had nested behind the cooling fan into an electric frenzy. The resulting arc-flash did not kill the cabinet; instead, it threw open the mono speaker with a shuddering, vocoded swing that wailed, "tell me which circuit tastes like daylight." Ren cut the session straight to four-track cassette by flashlight, and by morning the tape was being traded hand-to-hand in mall parking lots before the township could weld the doors shut.
